/-- noSideForced: the no-go threshold instance at head 1541354. Under the exact coupling
recursion D * dhat(n+1) = Q * dhat n + D * chat n (D = 30000000, Q = 30000), with launch
at its cap dhat 0 ≥ 1000000, floor at its cap chat 0 ≥ 39000, and the floor decaying no
faster than X0/D = 27840000/30000000 = 116/125 = 0.9280000 per window, the prefix sums are forced
above the budget head: sumTo dhat 111 ≥ 1541355. The chains are carried at the reduced
certificate scale 125^110. -/
